    {
      "id": "harmony-02-009",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "02",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "ForEach 的第三个参数 key 生成器最适合返回下列哪种值？",
      "explanation": "key 应稳定且唯一地标识数据身份，通常来自业务 id；数组下标会随插入、删除或排序变化，不能可靠表示同一条数据。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "ArkUI 基本语法概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-basic-syntax-overview"
        }
      ],
      "type": "single",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "每条数据稳定且唯一的业务 id 字符串"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "每次渲染都重新生成的随机字符串"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "所有列表项共用的同一个常量"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "插入或删除后必然变化的数组下标"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "harmony-02-010",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "02",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "Row 中不同高度的子组件需要在纵向上居中对齐，应设置哪个属性？",
      "explanation": "Row 的主轴为横向，纵向是其交叉轴，因此使用 alignItems(VerticalAlign.Center)；justifyContent 控制的是横向主轴分布。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "ArkUI 基本语法概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-basic-syntax-overview"
        }
      ],
      "type": "single",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "alignItems(VerticalAlign.Center)"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "alignItems(HorizontalAlign.Center)"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "justifyContent(FlexAlign.Center) 只设置这一项"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "alignContent(VerticalAlign.Center)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "harmony-02-011",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "02",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "stem": "下列哪些写法符合 ArkUI 自定义组件与 build() 的职责边界？",
      "explanation": "@Component struct 用于声明组件，@Builder 可抽取 UI 片段；初始化数据应放到合适生命周期，build 不应承担重复副作用，也没有浏览器 DOM 可操作。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "ArkUI 基本语法概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-basic-syntax-overview"
        },
        {
          "title": "创建自定义组件",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-create-custom-components"
        }
      ],
      "type": "multi",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "使用 @Component struct 声明自定义组件"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "使用 @Builder 抽取可复用的轻量 UI 结构"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "在 build 每次执行时启动新的定时器和网络请求"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "通过 document.querySelector 直接修改 Text 内容"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A",
        "B"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "harmony-02-012",
      "skill": "harmony",
      "module": "02",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "stem": "实现可增删的长列表时，下列哪些方案有助于保持身份正确并减少不必要的组件创建？",
      "explanation": "稳定业务 key 能保持数据身份，LazyForEach 配合 IDataSource 可按需创建列表项，List 中使用 ListItem；下标 key 在增删后可能指向不同数据。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "ArkUI 基本语法概述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-basic-syntax-overview"
        },
        {
          "title": "声明式 UI 描述",
          "url": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-declarative-ui-description"
        }
      ],
      "type": "multi",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "使用稳定唯一的业务 id 生成 key"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "长列表使用 LazyForEach 并提供 IDataSource"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "在 List 中用 ListItem 包裹普通列表项内容"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "增删排序时始终用数组下标作为稳定身份"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "C"
      ]
    }
